## Why This Is Asked

This question probes practical CKNE-driven resource isolation under multi-tenant churn, requiring concrete QoS decisions and testability.

## Key Concepts

- Per-tenant quotas linked to SLA tiers
- CKNE health aggregation across hops
- Adaptive throttling and backpressure
- Observability and testability

## Code Example

```javascript
// Pseudo-code for quota adjustment
function adjustQuota(tenant, health, baseQuota, minQuota, maxQuota) {
  const penalty = Math.max(0, 1 - health);
  const factor = 1 - 0.4 * penalty;
  const quota = Math.round(baseQuota * factor);
  return Math.max(minQuota, Math.min(maxQuota, quota));
}
```

